{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Ridgeline Wallet API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Player balances (cash, bonus, rewards) and rewards credits. All amounts are integer minor units (cents).\n\nPlayer balances (**cash**, **bonus**, **rewards**) and **rewards credits**. All amounts are integer cents.\n\n**Owner:** Team Payments · **Consumers:** bet-slip, promotions tooling, agents that issue rewards\n\nRewards credits are **idempotent**: send a unique `idempotency_key` per credit, and replaying a key never credits twice. Agents that move value should always generate a fresh key per intended credit.\n\n## Authentication\n\nSend `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. **Each API has its own key**, and a key for one API is rejected by the others.\n\nKeys are never handed out directly. Request access and you receive a **credential reference** such as `{{vault:RIDGELINE_BETS_KEY}}`. A secure access proxy (Postman Passport) swaps the reference for the real key at call time, so neither your code, your agent nor its logs ever hold the secret.\n\n| Response | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `401 unauthorized` | Missing key, or a key for a different API |\n| `401 unresolved_reference` | A `{{vault:...}}` reference reached the API unresolved: the call skipped the proxy |\n\n\n## Conventions\n\n- **Base URL:** `https://<host>/<api>`, e.g. `https://<host>/bets/v1/bets`. Paths are exact (no path parameters), so access grants can match method + host + path.\n- **Money:** every amount is an **integer in minor units (cents)**. `1000` = $10.00. Decimals are rejected.\n- **Products:** `sportsbook` or `casino`.\n- **Players:** sandbox players `P-1001` to `P-1005` (see each API's notes).\n- **Errors:** JSON `{ \"error\": \"<code>\", \"message\": \"<human readable>\" }`, plus extra fields where noted.\n- **Idempotency:** write endpoints that move value take an `idempotency_key` or are naturally idempotent (claims).\n\n*Ridgeline is a fictional company; all data is sandbox data.*",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Team Payments"
    },
    "x-owner": "Team Payments"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{host}/wallet",
      "description": "Hosted sandbox (route through Passport)",
      "variables": {
        "host": {
          "default": "your-project.vercel.app"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:4100/wallet",
      "description": "Local (next dev)"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "wallet",
      "description": "Player balances (cash, bonus, rewards) and rewards credits. All amounts are integer minor units (cents). Owner: Team Payments."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/wallet/balance": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "wallet"
        ],
        "operationId": "wallet_post_wallet_balance",
        "summary": "Get a player balance",
        "description": "Get a player's current balances.\n\n**Errors**\n\n| Status | `error` | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 404 | `player_not_found` | Unknown `player_id`. |\n| 401 | `unauthorized` / `unresolved_reference` | Missing or wrong key, or an unresolved Passport reference |",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {
                  "player_id": "P-1001",
                  "cash_minor": 25000,
                  "bonus_minor": 0,
                  "rewards_minor": 1200
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request: missing fields, invalid JSON or invalid values.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "missing_fields",
                  "message": "Missing required field(s): player_id.",
                  "fields": [
                    "player_id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid bearer key, or an unresolved Passport reference.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "Missing key or another API's key",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "message": "Missing or invalid bearer key for this API."
                    }
                  },
                  "unresolved_reference": {
                    "summary": "A {{vault:...}} reference skipped the proxy",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unresolved_reference",
                      "message": "Received an unresolved Passport reference. Route this call through the Passport Secure Access Proxy."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "`player_not_found`: Unknown `player_id`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "player_not_found": {
                    "summary": "Unknown player_id.",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "player_not_found",
                      "message": "Unknown player_id."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "internal",
                  "message": "Unexpected error."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "player_id"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "player_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Sandbox player ID, `P-1001` to `P-1005`."
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "player_id": "P-1001"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/wallet/rewards/credit": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "wallet"
        ],
        "operationId": "wallet_post_wallet_rewards_credit",
        "summary": "Credit rewards to a player (idempotent)",
        "description": "Credit rewards to a player. Idempotent on `idempotency_key`: the first call credits, replays return the current balance unchanged. **Check `player-limits` first.** Protected players (`may_receive_promotions: false`) must not receive promotional credits.\n\n**Errors**\n\n| Status | `error` | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 400 | `invalid_amount` | `amount_minor` is not a positive integer. |\n| 404 | `player_not_found` | Unknown `player_id`. |\n| 401 | `unauthorized` / `unresolved_reference` | Missing or wrong key, or an unresolved Passport reference |",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {
                  "player_id": "P-1001",
                  "rewards_minor": 1300,
                  "idempotency_key": "demo-credit-001"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "`invalid_amount`: `amount_minor` is not a positive integer.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "invalid_amount": {
                    "summary": "amount_minor is not a positive integer.",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "invalid_amount",
                      "message": "amount_minor is not a positive integer."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid bearer key, or an unresolved Passport reference.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "Missing key or another API's key",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "message": "Missing or invalid bearer key for this API."
                    }
                  },
                  "unresolved_reference": {
                    "summary": "A {{vault:...}} reference skipped the proxy",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unresolved_reference",
                      "message": "Received an unresolved Passport reference. Route this call through the Passport Secure Access Proxy."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "`player_not_found`: Unknown `player_id`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "player_not_found": {
                    "summary": "Unknown player_id.",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "player_not_found",
                      "message": "Unknown player_id."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "internal",
                  "message": "Unexpected error."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "player_id",
                  "amount_minor",
                  "reason",
                  "idempotency_key"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "player_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Sandbox player ID, `P-1001` to `P-1005`."
                  },
                  "amount_minor": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "description": "Amount in minor units (cents). Integer, at least 1."
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Why the credit was issued (shown in the ledger)."
                  },
                  "idempotency_key": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Unique key per credit. Replaying the same key returns the same result and never double-credits."
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "player_id": "P-1001",
                "amount_minor": 100,
                "reason": "Championship Rewards Boost",
                "idempotency_key": "demo-credit-001"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "Use the Passport reference {{vault:RIDGELINE_WALLET_KEY}}. Never a raw key."
      }
    }
  }
}
